國海軍056A護衛艦擁有均衡火力配置。（央視網）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260814/1164982871081881600419072.png/9TWl7X4qg9OBqFxfy9f-SPFwRi2q7DyO7xNb2-8TW9s\"/><figcaption>中國海軍056A護衛艦擁有均衡火力配置。（央視網）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"056A型護衛艦是中國海軍近海防禦體系中的基層力量。（央視網）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260814/1164983360125145088189567.png/9R7mgasNUW2-NEqToHU2vHx-2pNyvvxfIpJEdyKSRHc\"/><figcaption>056A型護衛艦是中國海軍近海防禦體系中的基層力量。（央視網）</figcaption></figure><p>【本文獲「晨楓新苑」授權轉載，微信公眾號：gh_9c4c9a36f81b】</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-04T05:38:05.539122+00:00","quality":{"score":3,"chars":5270,"images":37,"source":"HK01 熱話","fallback":"none"}}